## Spacing System (8px base)

```
4px   — gap within inline elements
8px   — tight spacing (icon + label)
12px  — compact padding
16px  — base padding (cards, inputs)
24px  — section elements gap
32px  — card padding, major gaps
48px  — section padding
64px  — section separation
96px  — page-level breathing room
```

Tailwind reference: `p-2 p-3 p-4 p-6 p-8 p-12 p-16 p-24`

