## Component Patterns

### Cards
```tsx
// Subject card, class card, homework card
<div className="
  rounded-xl border border-[--bg-border]
  bg-[--bg-surface]
  p-6
  transition-all duration-200 ease-out
  hover:border-[--accent]/30
  hover:bg-[--bg-overlay]
  hover:shadow-[0_0_24px_rgba(99,102,241,0.08)]
  cursor-pointer
">
```

### Buttons
```tsx
// Primary CTA
<button className="
  bg-[--accent] hover:bg-[--accent-hover]
  text-white font-medium
  px-5 py-2.5 rounded-lg
  transition-colors duration-150
  text-sm
">

// Secondary
<button className="
  border border-[--bg-border]
  bg-transparent hover:bg-[--bg-overlay]
  text-[--text-secondary] hover:text-[--text-primary]
  px-5 py-2.5 rounded-lg
  transition-all duration-150
  text-sm
">

// Ghost (sidebar nav, inline actions)
<button className="
  text-[--text-muted] hover:text-[--text-primary]
  hover:bg-[--bg-overlay]
  px-3 py-1.5 rounded-md
  transition-all duration-150
  text-sm
">
```

### Inputs
```tsx
<input className="
  w-full bg-[--bg-surface]
  border border-[--bg-border] focus:border-[--accent]
  rounded-lg px-4 py-2.5
  text-[--text-primary] placeholder:text-[--text-muted]
  outline-none ring-0
  focus:ring-1 focus:ring-[--accent]/30
  transition-all duration-150
  text-sm
" />
```

### Badges / Status
```tsx
// Class number, topic count, duration
<span className="
  inline-flex items-center
  text-[11px] font-medium uppercase tracking-widest
  text-[--text-muted]
  border border-[--bg-border]
  rounded-md px-2 py-0.5
">

// Active / accent
<span className="
  bg-[--accent-subtle] text-[--accent]
  text-[11px] font-medium uppercase tracking-widest
  rounded-md px-2 py-0.5
">
```

### Sidebar
```tsx
<aside className="
  w-60 h-screen sticky top-0
  bg-[--bg-surface] border-r border-[--bg-border]
  flex flex-col py-6 px-3
  gap-1
">
  // Nav items: ghost buttons, active state uses accent-subtle bg + accent text
```

