## Layout Principles

### Page Container
```tsx
<main className="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-8 py-12">
```

### Classroom Hub Grid
```tsx
<div className="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
```

### Subject Detail (Roadmap)
- Vertical timeline layout — classes as stacked cards with connecting line
- Progress line: `border-l-2 border-[--bg-border]` with `ml-4 pl-8`

### Active Class Page
- Full-viewport dark canvas
- Slide content centered, max-width 900px
- Voice controls as floating bottom bar (fixed, blurred background)

