## Animation

```css
/* Standard easing */
transition: all 200ms cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);

/* Page entrance — stagger children */
.animate-in {
  animation: fadeInUp 0.4s ease-out forwards;
}
@keyframes fadeInUp {
  from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(12px); }
  to   { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
}

/* Stagger via delay */
.child:nth-child(1) { animation-delay: 0ms; }
.child:nth-child(2) { animation-delay: 60ms; }
.child:nth-child(3) { animation-delay: 120ms; }
```

**Rules:**
- Hover transitions: `duration-150` to `duration-200` only
- Page transitions / entrance: `duration-300` to `duration-400`
- Never animate `width`, `height` — use `transform` and `opacity` only
- Loading states: subtle pulse (`animate-pulse`) on skeleton elements

