## Loading States

```tsx
// Skeleton card (subject loading)
<div className="rounded-xl bg-[--bg-surface] border border-[--bg-border] p-6 animate-pulse">
  <div className="h-4 bg-[--bg-overlay] rounded w-2/3 mb-3" />
  <div className="h-3 bg-[--bg-overlay] rounded w-1/3" />
</div>

// AI generating state
<div className="flex items-center gap-2 text-[--text-muted] text-sm">
  <span className="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[--accent] animate-ping" />
  Generating syllabus...
</div>
```

