## Anti-Patterns

❌ Never:
- Pure black or heavy dark backgrounds as default
- Purple gradients on white (generic AI aesthetic)
- Rounded-full pill buttons for primary actions
- Multiple accent colors
- Shadows heavier than `0 0 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.3)`
- Font size below 12px
- `font-weight: 700` or `font-weight: 800`
- Decorative elements that don't carry information
- Inline styles — use Tailwind classes or CSS variables

✅ Always:
- Light gray base with white/surface layers and subtle borders
- Single accent color (indigo) used purposefully
- Generous padding inside cards (p-6 minimum)
- Smooth 150-200ms transitions on interactive elements
- Clear visual hierarchy: primary → secondary → muted text
- Consistent border-radius: `rounded-lg` (8px) for inputs/buttons, `rounded-xl` (12px) for cards
